# Picnic Ruiner: "while you control a creature with power 4 or greater" is part of the trigger event, checked only as the Ruiner
# attacks and not again on resolution (no intervening "if", CR 603.4). Turn 1 Bot1 casts the Ruiner and an Alpine Grizzly (power 4).
# On turn 3 Bot2 exiles the Grizzly with Swords to Plowshares in response to the trigger: it still resolves, the Ruiner has double
# strike, and hits for 2 twice: Bot2 at 16. The Swords gives Bot1 4 life (24).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Picnic Ruiner
Alpine Grizzly
Mountain
Mountain x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Swords to Plowshares
Island x20

